---
title: "State Machine: SwapRequest"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Posted : post
    Posted --> Claimed : claim passes the rules
    Posted --> Withdrawn : poster takes it back
    Claimed --> Approved : approve, still passes
    Claimed --> Denied : deny
    Posted --> Cancelled : week unpublished
    Claimed --> Cancelled : week unpublished
    Approved --> [*]
    Denied --> [*]
    Withdrawn --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*] : both people get a notice
    note right of Posted
        a claim that fails a blocking rule
        is refused before anything changes
    end note
